---
// Side-by-side comparison of io.ReadAll (O(N) doubling heap allocs) vs Sum6Reader fixed 8 KB slice reuse.
const W = 900;
const H = 282;
---
<figure class="gtrrs">
  <div class="gtrrs-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison showing io.ReadAll doubling allocations across hundreds of megabytes versus Sum6Reader streaming arbitrarily large files inside a single fixed 8 KB scratch buffer.">
      {/* Left panel: io.ReadAll trap */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="430" height="254" rx="10" class="gtrrs-card is-red" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gtrrs-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. io.ReadAll(r) / os.ReadFile: O(N) doubling Heap spikes</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. io.ReadAll(r) / os.ReadFile: Phình Heap O(N) theo kích cỡ file</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="398" height="72" rx="6" class="gtrrs-box" />
      <text x="44" y="80" class="gtrrs-code">b, _ := io.ReadAll(r) // grows 512B -&gt; 1KB -&gt; 2KB...</text>
      <text x="44" y="99" class="gtrrs-code">lines := bytes.Split(b, []byte("\n")) // 10M slices</text>
      <text x="44" y="118" class="gtrrs-b-red">Measured 36 MB file: 304 MB Heap alloc (101 ms)!</text>

      <rect x="30" y="146" width="398" height="106" rx="6" class="gtrrs-box" />
      <text x="44" y="168" class="gtrrs-b-red">Why dangerous on multi-tenant APIs:</text>
      <text x="44" y="188" class="gtrrs-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>10 concurrent 100 MB uploads x copies = 3 GB spike!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>10 user tải 100 MB cùng lúc x copy = bung 3 GB RAM!</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="208" class="gtrrs-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Triggers OOMKill regardless of GOMEMLIMIT tuning.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đủ sức làm sập OOMKill pod ngay trước khi GC kịp dọn.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: Fixed 8 KB streaming sliding window */}
      <rect x="460" y="14" width="426" height="254" rx="10" class="gtrrs-card" />
      <text x="476" y="42" class="gtrrs-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Sum6Reader: Fixed 8 KB buffer (O(1) constant Heap!)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Sum6Reader: 1 buffer cố định 8 KB (O(1) RAM bất biến!)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="476" y="60" width="394" height="72" rx="6" class="gtrrs-box is-ok" />
      <text x="490" y="80" class="gtrrs-code">buf := make([]byte, 8*1024) // reusable 8KB slice</text>
      <text x="490" y="99" class="gtrrs-code">n, err := r.Read(buf[offset:]) // shift tail left</text>
      <text x="490" y="118" class="gtrrs-b-ok">100M lines (1 GB): STILL 8.4 KB Heap total (~18 ms)!</text>

      <rect x="476" y="146" width="394" height="106" rx="6" class="gtrrs-box is-ok" />
      <text x="490" y="168" class="gtrrs-b-ok">Key algorithm trick (copy tail leftover):</text>
      <text x="490" y="188" class="gtrrs-m">1. Scan up to last `\n` byte inside buf[:offset+n].</text>
      <text x="490" y="208" class="gtrrs-m">2. copy(buf[0:], buf[lastNL+1 : end]) shifts tail.</text>
      <text x="490" y="228" class="gtrrs-m">3. Zero intermediate slices, zero string() casts!</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Reading whole payloads into memory forces O(N) heap explosions under concurrency. Streaming across one caller-owned 8 KB sliding window drops RAM from 304 MB down to 8.4 KB regardless of file size.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đọc toàn bộ file vào RAM bằng io.ReadAll gây nổ bộ nhớ O(N) khi nhiều request tới cùng lúc. Đọc cuốn chiếu qua một cửa sổ 8 KB cố định kéo Heap từ 304 MB tụt thẳng xuống 8,4 KB dù file to cỡ nào.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gtrrs { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gtrrs-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gtrrs svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 680px; height: auto; }
  .gtrrs text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gtrrs-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gtrrs-card.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gtrrs-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gtrrs-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gtrrs-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gtrrs-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gtrrs-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gtrrs-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gtrrs-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gtrrs-code { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text); }
  .gtrrs-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gtrrs figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
